							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Grats LoS :D<br /><br />He has every right to post here. If I left the server I would definately keep reading here to see whats going on. Make a private forum if you dont want people not playing posting stuff.<br /></div><br />Dissention amoung the ranks? my god what has conviction come to?? since when have you all cared what the rest of the server thinked of you so much? <br /><br />stability and long term peacefulness comes when you do not pay attention so much to what others think of you, and instead live and play as you like while not disturbing the balance of the server.<br /><br />this board is full of opinions and the comments of those who do not even play the game (myself included since march 2005). take each persons words as you like.<br /><br />Kinladar has created a wonderful msg board here and even though he does not play EQ, and he has made it clear that he totally hates EQ since he has chosen to move on to WoW, I myself still do enjoy reading his posts. a free message board such as this is a great gift from him and the moderaters of this board. please do not speak so litely of moderation and banning those who do not play. let the masses decide whose opinions really count.<br /><br />&nbsp;i do not pretend to know what is actually happening in the world of rodcet nife, but i hope that the transition with the community of quellious goes smoothe, and that one day I might decide to return to the game myself.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
