							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yar&nbsp; is a silly easy fight for the reward.  Any fight you can win in 4 tries to me is not anything worth bragging about.<br /><br />its like winning Rikk. and saying your guild is climbing the ladder of top guilds. It&#039;s laughable!<br /><br /><br />btw I done this fight so I know how easy it is-P
