							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">they simply think youre just nasty, and belittling, meanspirited, and ignorant of what our server cares about.</div><br />i very much am all of the above, but i&#039;m also right.<br /><br />you can hate me all you want but that doesnt mean i&#039;m going to stop speaking my point of view.<br /><br />and you&#039;re right, i did say i quit eq about a month ago... but i lied, and still play my mage twink occasionally.
