	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16727"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=868" title="View the profile of Shrek">Shrek</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 22<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=868"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16727#msg16727"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16727#msg16727">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2801 on:</b> May 01, 2005, 05:20:44 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I could be wrong here, but reality is based on perception not the truth.&nbsp; The perception is some Conviction members came here bragging that they were #1 in something.<br /><br />There&#039;s nothing wrong with this, since everyone wants to be #1 ...<br /><br />In this case it just comes off as hollow.&nbsp; You beat an encounter, which DA/EiE could probably have done months ago.&nbsp; Why they didn&#039;t I don&#039;t know.&nbsp; But since even your own members shy away from stating they are #1 it just seems.... odd.<br /><br />There&#039;s nothing wrong with being proud of a server first, but to actually state you are #1 in something, when the &quot;competition&quot; is admittedly (by your own people) better than you are.&nbsp; They simply just didn&#039;t enter the race.<br /><br />Maybe the times have changed, people seem a lot less, animated.&nbsp; Back in the day, when DA/EiE was the first to kill the boss in lower acrylia, had I gone to VN and posted some lame duck, we&#039;re #1 in luclin post, I&#039;d have been laughed at by everyone on the server, let alone Ascent.&nbsp; The encounter was not very difficult, and had Ascent put any effort into it they could have done it.<br /><br />Maybe I&#039;m just too old school, but you didn&#039;t say you were #1 unless you really were.&nbsp; A server first, is one thing, being #1 is another.&nbsp; The arguement that we can be #1 in this and you can be #1 in that just doesn&#039;t hold water for me.&nbsp; RN, and EQ in general has had a very distinct meaning behind being #1.<br /><br />If you are not the best, then you are not #1.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
